      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "MOSS-Image Layout Guide",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Unified Layout on MOSS-Image\n\nOpen **Layout** to edit boxes, mixins, visual references, and per-box / per-mixin LoRAs in one place:\n\n- **Mixins**: attach LoRAs, trigger words, or reference images to *Left Woman* or *Right Woman* (and save reusable mixins to the library).\n- **Per-box LoRAs & refs**: attach a style LoRA directly to one box \u2014 `Backdrop` is enabled so `isolation` keeps it from bleeding into the park.\n- **Painted shapes**: switch any box to Paint or SAM3 capture when you want a silhouette instead of a rectangle.\n- **Layout Overlay**: draws the boxes over the render and sends the result back to Layout as a trace image.\n- **Speed tip**: when you don't need `isolation` (e.g. character LoRAs or pure regional prompts), set `isolation = 0` on Layout Apply to use MOSS's fast unmasked split attention."
      ]
    }
